grateful|Thanks for benefit rather than simple pleasure. Neighbour help/moving context preserved; to recipient and for cause complements separated correctly.
liquid|Substance noun and physical-state adjective have distinct source ordinals. Pouring liquid and melted wax examples align in Vietnamese; no financial liquidity Sense or universal temperature threshold invented.
